INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (1,NULL,NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'<p>The Archive by Imtiaz is a residential project developed by Imtiaz Developments and situated within the Dubai Land Residence Complex (DLRC). The development consists of a basement level, ground floor, three podium levels, thirteen residential floors, and a rooftop. Residents are provided with a wide range of amenities designed for leisure, recreation, and relaxation. These include a library, reading lounge, writer’s room, reading salon, fitness center, rooftop swimming pools for adults and children, an outdoor cinema, floating cabanas, a shallow-water lounge area, mini-golf facilities, a children’s play area, and a dedicated pet area. The development is conveniently positioned near several major destinations. Dubai Academic City and Dubai Silicon Mall can be reached within approximately five minutes, while IMG Worlds of Adventure and Global Village are around ten minutes away. The Mohammed Bin Rashid Library is approximately fifteen minutes from the property, and Dubai International Airport can be reached within about twenty minutes.</p>',NULL,'Imtiaz Developments',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786289760_Main.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% Booking\n5% November 2026\n5% April 2027\n5% August 2027\n5% November 2027\n5% February 2028\n5% July 2028\n50% On Completion','AED',666000.0000,'Apartments',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dubai’s Literary-Inspired Resort-Style Residence',NULL,NULL,NULL,'the-archive-by-imtiaz','launched','The Archive by Imtiaz',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 07:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-land');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (2,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'<p>Le Château Piétrus is an exclusive waterfront residential development by Mr. Eight Development, located on Dubai Islands. The boutique seven-storey development comprises only 86 residences, including 73 two-bedroom apartments, 12 three-bedroom apartments, and one four-bedroom penthouse. Designed with a focus on privacy and refined coastal living, the residences feature spacious layouts, premium interiors and waterfront surroundings. Residents have access to resort-style amenities including swimming pools, wellness and fitness facilities, landscaped outdoor spaces, a residents’ lounge and leisure areas. The development is positioned opposite the marina and beside a municipal park, with convenient access to Dubai Islands Beach, Waterfront Market, Dubai Creek, Dubai International Airport and Downtown Dubai.</p>',NULL,'Mr. Eight Developments',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786289197_ChatGPT Image Aug 9, 2026, 10_30_35 PM.png',NULL,NULL,'5 min - Dubai Islands Beach\n5 min - Waterfront Market\n10 min - Dubai Creek\n15 min - Deira City Centre\n15 min - Hyatt Regency Dubai\n20 min - Dubai International Airport\n30 min - Downtown Dubai',NULL,'20% Booking\n15% During Construction\n65% On Handover','AED',709000.0000,'Apartments',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Exclusive Waterfront Living on Dubai Islands',NULL,NULL,NULL,'le-chateau-pietrus','under_construction','Le Château Piétrus',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 06:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-islands');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (3,NULL,NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'<p>The Oasis by Emaar is one of Emaar\'s major high-end residential communities in Dubai, spanning approximately 9.4 million square metres and planned for around 7,000 residences. The master development offers luxury townhouses, villas, mansions and super-mansions, with homes ranging from three to six bedrooms. The community is designed around extensive waterways, lagoons, beaches, parks and landscaped open spaces, emphasizing privacy, indoor-outdoor living and waterfront views. Amenities highlighted in the brochure include community parks, playgrounds, beaches, outdoor jogging and cycling tracks, swimming pools, pocket parks, wellness and spa facilities, schools, sports and fitness facilities, mosques, retail and dining. The brochure also highlights approximately 140,000 sq.m. of retail space. Location guidance states approximately 18 minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport, 20 minutes to Dubai Hills Estate/Dubai Hills Mall, 28 minutes to Dubai Marina/Dubai Marina Mall, and 35 minutes to Downtown Dubai/Dubai Mall.</p>',NULL,'Emaar',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786284629_Banner.jpg',NULL,NULL,'18 min - Al Maktoum International Airport\n20 min - Dubai Hills Estate & Mall\n28 min - Dubai Marina\n35 min - Downtown Dubai and Burj Khalifa',NULL,'10% Down Payment\n70% During Construction\n20% On Completion','AED',16500000.0000,'Villas',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dubai&#039;s Ultimate Resort-Style Villa Sanctuary',NULL,NULL,NULL,'the-oasis-by-emaar','launched','The Oasis by Emaar',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 05:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-land');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (4,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'<p>Valia by Emaar is a sophisticated high-rise residential development in Dubai Creek Harbour, combining contemporary architecture with a vibrant mixed-use setting. The residences range from 1-bedroom to 4-bedroom apartments, with thoughtfully planned layouts, premium finishes, high window glazing, sleek aluminium cladding and a dedicated balcony for every home. Amenities focus on wellness, recreation and family life, including a temperature-controlled swimming pool, kids’ pool, yoga deck, BBQ area, private cabanas, outdoor fitness area, Padel court, splash pad and outdoor children’s play zones. The development is positioned close to Creek Marina, Harbor Promenade, Central Park, Creek Beach, Dubai Square Mall and the planned Emaar Properties (Iconic) Blue Line Metro station. The brochure indicates approximate travel times of 10 minutes to Dubai International Airport, 15 minutes to Burj Khalifa/Downtown Dubai, 25 minutes to Dubai Marina and 40 minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport.</p>',NULL,'Emaar',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786283717_main (1).webp',NULL,NULL,'10 min - Dubai International Airport\n15 min - Burj Khalifa / Downtown Dubai\n25 min - Dubai Marina\n40 min - Al Maktoum International Airport',NULL,'10% Down Payment\n70% During Construction\n20% On Handover','AED',1800000.0000,'Apartments',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Valia is a contemporary high-rise residential development by Emaar at Dubai Creek Harbour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'valia-tower','launched','Valia Tower',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 04:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-creek-harbour');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (5,NULL,NULL,NULL,11,NULL,'<p>Lunaya is a nature-led residential community in Jebel Ali, Dubai, developed through a joint venture between ZAYA and FIVE Holdings. Positioned approximately 2.5 km off Sheikh Zayed Road, the low-density community is planned around 65% green space and a 900,000 sq.ft. swimmable lagoon. Its collection includes The Bloom, a 4-bedroom townhouse of approximately 2,966 sq.ft.; The Rise, a 4-bedroom maisonette of approximately 3,814 sq.ft.; The Dune, a 5-bedroom duet of approximately 6,635 sq.ft.; and The Sol, a 5-bedroom detached villa of approximately 8,231 sq.ft. Homes are designed around soft curves, natural light, organic materials and seamless indoor-outdoor living, with selected residences overlooking parks and lagoons and larger homes incorporating private swimming pools. The community emphasizes wellness, movement and family life, with landscaped nature, waterways and lifestyle amenities. Lunaya also benefits from connectivity to Dubai Parks &amp;amp; Resorts, The Outlet Village, Dubai South, Expo City, Palm Jebel Ali and Al Maktoum International Airport.</p>',NULL,'Zaya',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786284158_Main (2).png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'25% Down Payment\n15% During Construction\n60% Handover','AED',5000000.0000,'Villas',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dubai&#039;s Premier Lagoon Living Community',NULL,NULL,NULL,'lunaya','launched','Lunaya',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 03:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jebel-ali');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (6,NULL,NULL,NULL,11,NULL,'<p>Cedarwood Estates - South is an exclusive villa collection by Wasl, positioned on the southern side of Jumeirah Golf Estates: The Next Chapter in Jebel Ali. The development comprises just 74 golf villas, creating a low-density residential setting surrounded by landscaped greenery and sweeping fairways. The collection includes 39 four-bedroom, 13 five-bedroom and 22 six-bedroom villas, with saleable areas ranging from 6,085 sq.ft. to 9,212 sq.ft. Contemporary architecture places a strong emphasis on natural light and indoor-outdoor flow, with floor-to-ceiling windows, double-height entrances, sheltered terraces and private courtyards. Each villa includes a private swimming pool, landscaped garden, BBQ area, fitted kitchen with island and walk-in pantry, en-suite bedrooms, dedicated lifestyle spaces, an elevator and covered parking for three vehicles. Residents also benefit from concierge services, security control, basic home automation, EV charging provision and guest valet parking. The wider Jumeirah Golf Estates master plan incorporates lifestyle amenities including an 18-hole golf course, country club, equestrian centre, central park, cycling and jogging tracks, tennis facilities, an international school, hospital and planned transport connections. Located between Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Zayed Bin Hamdan Road, Cedarwood Estates - South combines generous private residences with a landscaped golf-community lifestyle.</p>',NULL,'Wasl',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786281723_main.webp',NULL,NULL,'10 min - Dubai Marina\n15 min - Palm Jumeirah\n15 min - Al Maktoum International Airport\n20 min - Downtown Dubai\n30 min - Dubai Airport',NULL,NULL,'AED',13350000.0000,'Villas',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cedarwood Estates - South by Wasl The Next Chapter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'cedarwood-estates-south','launched','Cedarwood Estates - South',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 02:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jebel-ali');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (7,NULL,NULL,NULL,18,NULL,'<p>The Canopies at Yas Point by Aldar is the first residential collection within Yas Point, a new waterfront destination at the northernmost point of Yas Island in Abu Dhabi. The garden-led community offers spacious studio to 3-bedroom apartments designed around natural light, openness and connection to the landscape, with views across the community park. Residents enjoy five-star resort-style amenities including The Canopy Club social living room, resort-style pools and a dedicated splash pool, The Clearing outdoor wellness pavilion, The Afterglow illuminated garden, and a range of spaces for gathering, relaxation and family life. The wider Yas Point masterplan combines a 700-metre waterfront promenade, open-water beach, Wonder Pool infinity pool, water taxi access, three signature parks including the 60,000 sqm Lea Park, landscaped walking and cycling routes, outdoor wellness spaces, neighbourhood gardens, dining and retail, The Hub co-working and community space, The Night Garden and Kids’ Studio. Yas Point spans approximately 600,000 sqm and is planned for around 1,600 residences and 5,000 residents, with a gross development value of AED 6 billion. The location is approximately 3 minutes from Yas Mall, 10 minutes from Zayed International Airport, 15 minutes from Abu Dhabi city centre and Saadiyat Island, and 50 minutes from Dubai.</p>',NULL,'Aldar',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786281958_main.png',NULL,NULL,'5 Minutes – Yas Mall\n5 Minutes – Ferrari World Abu Dhabi\n10 Minutes – Zayed International Airport\n15 Minutes – Saadiyat Island\n20 Minutes – The Corniche\n50 Minutes – Dubai',NULL,'5% On booking - Down Payment\n50% During Construction\n45% On Handover','AED',1650000.0000,'Apartments',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Canopies at Yas Point by Aldar is the first residential collection within Yas Point, a new waterfront destination at the northernmost point of Yas Island in Abu Dhabi. The garden-led community off...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'the-canopies-at-yas-point','launched','The Canopies at Yas Point',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 01:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','yas-island');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (8,NULL,NULL,NULL,12,NULL,'<p>Solaya is an exclusive beachfront residential development created through a collaboration between Meraas and Brookfield Properties, with architecture by Foster + Partners and interiors by 1508 London. Positioned along Jumeirah’s coastline, the private collection comprises 234 residences across nine beachfront buildings, with Downtown Dubai approximately 15 minutes away and Dubai International Airport around 20 minutes by car. Residences range from spacious 2 to 5-bedroom homes to signature 4-bedroom duplexes and penthouses. Interiors are designed around natural light, open-plan living and a restrained contemporary palette, complemented by high-end finishes, generous windows, sea-facing terraces, private balconies and courtyards. Every residence benefits from direct lift access into a private lobby, supported by separate service elevators. Solaya combines its coastal setting with an extensive lifestyle offering. Residents enjoy direct beach access alongside swimming pools, landscaped gardens, a Beach Park, yoga deck, wellness and fitness facilities, an in-house spa with sauna and treatment rooms, private cinema, residents’ lounge and meeting spaces. Services include 24/7 security, valet parking, concierge, doorman and porter assistance and buggy drop-off. Neighbouring J1 Beach adds a selection of restaurants and beach clubs, creating a private residential environment that remains closely connected to Dubai’s city lifestyle.</p>',NULL,'Meraas',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786282359_Main.png',NULL,NULL,'10 mins - Mandarin Oriental Jumeira\n10 mins - Four Seasons Resort Dubai\n20 mins - DIFC\n20 mins - Downtown and Dubai Mall\n30 mins - Dubai International Airport',NULL,'20% Down Payment\n40% During Construction\n40% Handover4','AED',14200000.0000,'Apartments',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Solaya is an exclusive beachfront residential development created through a collaboration between Meraas and Brookfield Properties, with architecture by Foster + Partners and interiors by 1508 London....',NULL,NULL,NULL,'solaya','launched','Solaya',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 00:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jumeirah-la-mer');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (9,NULL,NULL,'uploads/developments/brochures/1786257481_MAreva.pdf',8,NULL,'<p>The Oasis by Emaar presents a wealth of amenities designed to enrich residents\' lives and foster a vibrant community atmosphere. Within this expansive master community, residents have access to beautifully landscaped parks, jogging tracks, and local mosques, offering serene spaces for relaxation. With convenient access to pristine beaches and a central location, leisure and exploration are effortlessly woven into daily life.</p>',NULL,'Emaar',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1786257481_page01_img1.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% — On booking\n70% — During construction, through scheduled installments\n20% — On handover','AED',12000000.0000,'Villa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Oasis by Emaar presents a wealth of amenities designed to enrich residents&#039; lives and foster a vibrant community atmosphere. Within this expansive master community, residents have access to beauti...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'mareva','launched','Mareva',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 23:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-land');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (10,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'<p>Silena Residences is a premium complex on Dubai Islands, comprising three buildings united by a common ground floor and rising seven residential levels above. The triad of elegant volumes includes 137 unique housing units: from stylish apartments with 1-3 bedrooms to spacious duplex townhouses and sky villas with 3-4 bedrooms and penthouses with 4-5 bedrooms. The facade is made in light colors with panoramic glazing, reflecting the play of light and water.</p>',NULL,'AVENEW',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783952882_5acdf1af_9767_4879_a576_969fd99530d9_b0e2eda170.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% DLD + 3500 AED On booking\n40% During construction\n50% On completion','AED',4050000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Silena Residences is a premium complex on Dubai Islands, comprising three buildings united by a common ground floor and rising seven residential levels above. The triad of elegant volumes includes 137...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'silena-residences','launched','Silena Residences',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 22:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-islands');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (11,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'<p>Urban Horizon by Arete is a residential development by Arete Developments, located in the Arjan district of Dubai. The building, with its dynamic façades and expressive forms, creates an elegant silhouette that blends harmoniously into the urban landscape. The project comprises a ground floor, three podium levels, ten residential floors, and a rooftop. The development offers studios and one- and two-bedroom apartments. Spacious layouts, modern interiors, neutral tones, and floor-to-ceiling windows create a comfortable atmosphere filled with natural light and warmth.</p>',NULL,'Arete',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783952239_001_main_87c267ccaa.jpeg',NULL,NULL,'The complex also benefits from excellent connectivity:\nJumeirah Village Circle, Motor City, and Dubai Science Park — 5 minutes, Mall of the Emirates',NULL,'5% + 4% DLD + 4000 AED Admin fee On booking\n15% Within 30 days of booking\n10% In April 2026\n10% In July 2026\n5% In October 2026\n5% In January 2027\n50% On completion','AED',641333.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Urban Horizon by Arete is a residential development by Arete Developments, located in the Arjan district of Dubai. The building, with its dynamic façades and expressive forms, creates an elegant silho...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'urban-horizon','launched','Urban Horizon',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 21:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','arjan');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (12,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'<p>Allegro Park is a boutique residential development on Dubai Islands by Mill Hill Developers, presented by ABRA. The project offers spacious 1-, 2-, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as 3-bedroom duplexes featuring thoughtfully designed layouts and floor-to-ceiling panoramic windows.</p>',NULL,'ABRA',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783951636_Featured_Off_Plan_Artboard_3_21e175aa5e.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% DLD + 5000 AED Admin Fee On Booking\n10% 30 days from booking\n10% 9 months from booking\n70% On handover','AED',1500000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Allegro Park is a boutique residential development on Dubai Islands by Mill Hill Developers, presented by ABRA. The project offers spacious 1-, 2-, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as 3-bedroom duple...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'allegro-park','launched','Allegro Park',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 20:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-islands');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (13,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'<p>ELLE Residences Dubai Islands is a premium residential complex from ANAX Developments, created in collaboration with the famous international lifestyle media brand ELLE, whose editorial aesthetics and spirit inspire every detail of architecture. The building have sculptural forms and panoramic facades, includes a ground floor, a two-level podium, and ten residential floors.</p>',NULL,'Anax Development',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,1,'uploads/developments/1783950129_28f5dfc6_d924_42b8_9f56_95cfe62f7f04_2704c75b99.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% DLD + 5000 AED Admin fee + 1100 AED Registration fees On booking\n10% March 2026\n5% August 2026\n5% February 2027\n70% On completion','AED',2821777.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ELLE Residences Dubai Islands is a premium residential complex from ANAX Developments, created in collaboration with the famous international lifestyle media brand ELLE, whose editorial aesthetics and...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'elle-residences-dubai-islands','launched','ELLE Residences Dubai Islands',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 19:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-islands');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (14,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'<p>Lyvia by Palace is a project by Emaar located in Green Gate at Dubai Creek Harbour, featuring a basement, ground, two podium levels, 47 residential floors, and a roof. The collection includes 1–3 BR apartments and 3 BR townhouses. The building showcases a contemporary design with natural aesthetics characteristic of the Palace brand. Interiors are finished in neutral tones with rich textures and panoramic windows offering views of the waterfront and cityscape. Residents enjoy access to an infinity pool, kids’ area, fitness and yoga spaces, a padel court, and landscaped terraces and gardens. Lyvia by Palace is set close to the waterfront promenades and Creek Beach; Downtown Dubai and Burj Khalifa are about 25 minutes away, while Dubai International Airport is around 20 minutes by car.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783949833_Emaar_Lyvia_by_Palace_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_921d8369f6_cb9f416a7c.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% May 2026\n10% October 2026\n10% April 2027\n10% March 2028\n10% September 2028\n20% On handover\n10% December 2025\n10% October 2027\n10% On booking','AED',2092888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lyvia by Palace is a project by Emaar located in Green Gate at Dubai Creek Harbour, featuring a basement, ground, two podium levels, 47 residential floors, and a roof. The collection includes 1–3 BR a...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'lyvia-by-palace','launched','Lyvia by Palace',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 18:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-creek-harbour');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (15,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>Nexara by 7th Key is a residential high-rise by 7th Key Development located in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle. The tower combines modern design with clean lines and practical layouts, creating a balance of comfort and style. The complex offers one-, two-, and three-bedroom apartments with spacious layouts and high-quality finishes. Interiors are designed in a contemporary style, emphasizing space, natural light, and quality materials, creating a cozy and stylish atmosphere.</p>',NULL,'7th Key',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783949492_just_1_1_of_1_7a3eefda12.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% + 4% DLD On booking\nDuring construction On completion\n10% On handover\n3% 33 months after the booking\n3% 37 months after the booking\n3% 40 months after the booking\n3% 43 months after the booking\n6% 46 months after the booking\n3% 49 months after the booking\n3% 52 months after the booking\n3% 55 months after the booking\n3% 58 months after the booking\n10% 60 months after booking','AED',900000.0000,'Apartments & Duplexes',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nexara by 7th Key is a residential high-rise by 7th Key Development located in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle. The tower combines modern design with clean lines and practical layouts, creating a...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'nexara','launched','Nexara',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 17:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (16,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'<p>Binghatti Hillcrest is a project by the developer Binghatti, located in the Arjan community. The building consists of a basement level, a ground level, four residential floors, and a rooftop. The collection includes studios, 1- and 2-bedroom apartments, as well as commercial spaces. The architecture reflects Binghatti’s signature style, emphasizing modern geometric facades and expressive lines.</p>',NULL,'Binghatti',NULL,0,'2026-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783946009_80b75568_3f7d_4edb_bfdd_5fdc61af75f0_b0a87ceac1.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% + 4% + 5000 AED admin fee On booking\n17% In April 2026\n17% In July 2026\n16% In Jctober 2026\n30% On completion','AED',820999.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Binghatti Hillcrest is a project by the developer Binghatti, located in the Arjan community. The building consists of a basement level, a ground level, four residential floors, and a rooftop. The coll...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'binghatti-hillcrest','launched','Binghatti Hillcrest',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 16:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','arjan');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (17,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'<p>Livia Residences is an exquisite boutique project from the developer Barco Developers, located in the prestigious Dubai South area, Dubai. The building\'s architecture, combining elegance and functionality in a modern design, includes a ground floor, 6 residential levels and a roof with amenities. The complex features cozy studios and elegant apartments with 1-2 bedrooms, the interiors of which are made using high-quality materials. All the residences have a well-thought-out layout and high ceilings, and the kitchens are equipped with premium Smeg appliances, creating an atmosphere of comfort and style.</p>',NULL,'BARCO DEVELOPERS',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783944781_001_main_94c3ddc7e3.jpeg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% On booking\n10% + 4% DLD + 5250 AED Admin Fee + Vat Within 30 days from the date of booking or signing the SPA\n10% (1% per month) From the 1st to the 10th month from the date of signing the SPA\n70% On completion','AED',983555.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Livia Residences is an exquisite boutique project from the developer Barco Developers, located in the prestigious Dubai South area, Dubai. The building&#039;s architecture, combining elegance and functiona...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'livia-residences','launched','Livia Residences',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 15:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-south');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (18,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'<p>Creek Bay by Emaar is a contemporary waterfront residential development located in the heart of Dubai Creek Harbour, one of Dubai’s most sought-after lifestyle destinations. The project comprises three modern towers, thoughtfully designed to maximize views, convenience and community living.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,1,'uploads/developments/1783944367_Banner_e7b96c7596_8f3a725866.webp',NULL,NULL,'Waterfront Living Connected to the City\nCreek Bay by Emaar Properties is located in Dubai Creek Harbour, offering seamless access to Ras Al Khor Road (E44).\nSet alongside the Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, the community delivers a rare balance of scenic views, walkable promenades, a world-class marina, and easy access to both Downtown Dubai and the city’s historic Creek.\nWith major future landmarks like the Dubai Creek Tower and continuous infrastructure development underway, the area is rapidly becoming a high-demand investment hub.\n5 Minutes – Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary\n10 Minutes – Dubai International Airport\n15 Minutes – Burj Khalifa & Downtown Dubai\n25 Minutes – Dubai Marina\n40 Minutes – Al Maktoum International Airport',NULL,'10% On booking\n10% January 2026\n10% July 2026\n10% January 2027\n10% February 2028\n10% August 2028\n10% January 2029\n20% On handover','AED',1800000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Creek Bay by Emaar is a contemporary waterfront residential development located in the heart of Dubai Creek Harbour, one of Dubai’s most sought-after lifestyle destinations. The project comprises thre...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'creek-bay','launched','Creek Bay',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 14:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-creek-harbour');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (19,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'<p>Avarra by Palace is a refined waterfront residential community by EMAAR that embodies elevated coastal living with a signature touch of Palace luxury. Designed to offer a seamless blend of elegance, comfort, and exclusivity, the project features meticulously crafted residences with expansive layouts, sophisticated interiors, and panoramic views.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783943979_A2_bbc33a3e86.jpeg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% On booking\n10% January 2026\n5% June 2026\n5% November 2026\n10% April 2027\n5% September 2027\n10% April 2028\n5% September 2028\n10% March 2029\n10% September 2029\n10% April 2030\n10% On handover','AED',2704888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Avarra by Palace is a refined waterfront residential community by EMAAR that embodies elevated coastal living with a signature touch of Palace luxury. Designed to offer a seamless blend of elegance, c...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'avarra-by-palace','launched','Avarra by Palace',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 13:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','business-bay');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (20,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'<p>Creek Haven is a project by the developer Emaar in Dubai Creek Harbour, featuring one basement level, a ground level, three podium levels, and thirty residential floors. The collection offers one, two and three-bedroom apartments. Creek Haven stands out with its modern façades and blends harmoniously into the surrounding landscape with views of the park, the Burj Khalifa, and the Downtown Dubai skyline.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783943595_Creek_haven_dubai_creek_a7d2e1b862.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% On Booking\n10% Jan 2026\n10% Jul 2026\n10% Jan 2027\n10% Jul 2027\n10% Feb 2028\n10% Feb 2028\n10% Jan 2029\n20% March 2030','AED',1951888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Creek Haven is a project by the developer Emaar in Dubai Creek Harbour, featuring one basement level, a ground level, three podium levels, and thirty residential floors. The collection offers one, two...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'creek-haven','launched','Creek Haven',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 12:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-creek-harbour');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (21,NULL,NULL,NULL,16,NULL,'<p>Pier Point is a luxurious residential complex by Emaar, located in Mina Rashid. The building consists of a ground level, a podium level, nine residential floors, and a rooftop. Each residence is designed to maximize space and natural light, offering a modern, open-plan layout.Pier Point offers a variety of living options, from elegant 1-bedroom apartments to spacious 3-bedroom homes. Every residence features a thoughtful design, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows, providing breathtaking views.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783943177_Pier_Point_Emaar_Rashid_yachts_marina_b9198fbb58.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% Sept 2024\n10% Nov 2024\n10% Apr 2025\n10% Sep 2025\n10% Jun 2026\n10% Nov 2026\n10% May 2027\n10% Sep 2027\n20% Oct 2028','AED',3193887.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pier Point is a luxurious residential complex by Emaar, located in Mina Rashid. The building consists of a ground level, a podium level, nine residential floors, and a rooftop. Each residence is desig...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'pier-point','launched','Pier Point',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 11:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','rashid-yachts-and-marina');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (22,NULL,NULL,NULL,16,NULL,'<p>Pier Point 2 is a luxurious residential complex by Emaar, located in the Mina Rashid district. The building features a ground level, a podium level, and two residential sections of 6 and 10 floors, each crowned with its own rooftop. The residences are designed to maximize space and natural light, offering modern, open-plan layouts.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783942712_Pier_Point_2_9a9c40b402.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% Sep 2026\n10% Nov 2024\n10% Apr 2025\n10% Sep 2025\n10% Jun 2025\n10% Nov 2026\n10% May 2027\n10% Sep 2027\n20% Oct 2028','AED',3194888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pier Point 2 is a luxurious residential complex by Emaar, located in the Mina Rashid district. The building features a ground level, a podium level, and two residential sections of 6 and 10 floors, ea...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'pier-point-2','launched','Pier Point 2',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 10:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','rashid-yachts-and-marina');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (23,NULL,NULL,NULL,16,NULL,'<p>Porto View by Emaar is a premium waterfront development in Mina Rashid, offering direct marina access and panoramic sea views. The project features elegantly designed 1 to 3 bedroom apartments and exclusive 3 bedroom townhouses within a contemporary structure comprising a ground level, podium, and two residential towers of 6 and 9 floors, each crowned with its own rooftop. With sleek façade lines, refined finishes, and meticulous detailing, Porto View delivers a sophisticated yet comfortable coastal living experience.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783942384_HERO_1620_X832_1_6_5d212f6d1d.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% Sep 2024\n10% Nov 2024\n10% Apr 2025\n10% Sep 2025\n10% Jun 2026\n10% Nov 2026\n10% May 2027\n10% Sep 2027\n20% Oct 2028','AED',3192887.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Porto View by Emaar is a premium waterfront development in Mina Rashid, offering direct marina access and panoramic sea views. The project features elegantly designed 1 to 3 bedroom apartments and exc...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'porto-view','launched','Porto View',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 09:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','rashid-yachts-and-marina');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (24,NULL,NULL,NULL,16,NULL,'<p>Sera 2 at Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina by Emaar is a nautically inspired residential tower in Mina Rashid, featuring a ground level, podium, and six residential floors with a curated selection of 1 to 3 bedroom apartments and exclusive three bedroom townhouses. Designed in soft sandy tones with light blue glass and champagne accents, the façade reflects a refined coastal aesthetic, while interiors embrace natural hues, warm textures, and spacious layouts overlooking pools, landscaped greenery, and the city skyline, blending modern comfort with a relaxed resort-style ambiance.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783942021_rashid_51bea047af.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% On booking\n10% Oct 2025\n10% Apr 2026\n10% Oct 2026\n10% Mar 2027\n10% Nov 2027\n10% Apr 2028\n10% Aug 2028\n20% Nov 2029','AED',2111888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sera 2 at Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina by Emaar is a nautically inspired residential tower in Mina Rashid, featuring a ground level, podium, and six residential floors with a curated selection of 1 to 3 bed...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sera-2-at-rashid-yachts-marina','launched','Sera 2 at Rashid Yachts & Marina',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 08:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','rashid-yachts-and-marina');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (25,NULL,NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'<p>Marèva is a project by Emaar in The Oasis, offering an exclusive collection of secluded residences set among winding waterways and lush greenery. The community includes four-, five-, and six-bedroom villas designed to capture natural light and open views, creating a sense of space and privacy.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2030-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783940743_mareva_0cac4c24b0.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% On Booking\n10% Feb 2026\n10% Aug 2026\n10% Feb 2027\n10% Aug 2027\n10% Jan 2028\n10% Nov 2028\n10% May 2029\n20% Feb 2030','AED',13469999.0000,'Villa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Marèva is a project by Emaar in The Oasis, offering an exclusive collection of secluded residences set among winding waterways and lush greenery. The community includes four-, five-, and six-bedroom v...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'mareva-at-the-oasis','launched','Marèva at The Oasis',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 07:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-land');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (26,NULL,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,'<p>Ovelle is a residential villa project by Emaar, located within The Valley community, offering a refined collection of four- and five-bedroom villas designed for peaceful, family-oriented living. Set amid expansive natural landscapes, the community provides a calm retreat away from the city while remaining well connected to key areas of Dubai.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783940199_ovelle_74934b7796.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'80% Down payment\n20% Completion','AED',8855887.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ovelle is a residential villa project by Emaar, located within The Valley community, offering a refined collection of four- and five-bedroom villas designed for peaceful, family-oriented living. Set a...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ovelle','launched','Ovelle',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 06:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','the-valley');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (27,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,NULL,'<p>Palace Residences Hillside is a project by Emaar, located in the Dubai Hills Estate community. The complex consists of a ground level, a podium, and twenty residential floors. It offers one-, two-, and three-bedroom apartments, as well as spacious three-bedroom townhouses.</p>',NULL,'EMAAR',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783939345_a93551ce9_aecf_48cd_bbfe_2709a8d4ee01_3e5096e6bf.jpeg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% DLD + 3000 AED Oqood On booking\n10% March 2026\n10% August 2026\n10% January 2027\n10% June 2027\n10% September 2027\n10% January 2028\n10% July 2028\n20% On 100% construction and handover','AED',1719888.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Palace Residences Hillside is a project by Emaar, located in the Dubai Hills Estate community. The complex consists of a ground level, a podium, and twenty residential floors. It offers one-, two-, an...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'palace-residences-hillside','launched','Palace Residences Hillside',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 05:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-hills-estate');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (28,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>The project featured studios, 1 and 2 bedroom apartments, and 3 bedroom duplexes, offering a range of options for residents seeking a refined urban lifestyle.</p>',NULL,'HMB',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783938592_Havelock_building_59461e7041.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% Now\n10% 60 days\n10% 20% Completion\n10% 40% Completion\n10% 60% Completion\n40% 100% Completion','AED',679999.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The project featured studios, 1 and 2 bedroom apartments, and 3 bedroom duplexes, offering a range of options for residents seeking a refined urban lifestyle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'havelock-heights','launched','Havelock Heights',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 04:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (29,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>The exterior showcased a cascading composition where architecture, nature, and luxury blended seamlessly. The development featured a ground floor, a podium level, and five residential floors, offering studios and 1 and 2 bedroom apartments.</p>',NULL,'Avelon',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783938231_Homepage_Featured_Projects_Desktop_scaled_1e168ead16.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% On Booking\n10% In 90 Days\n10% On 20% Construction Completion\n10% On 40% Construction Completion\n10% On 60% Construction Completion\n40% On Project Completion','AED',785000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The exterior showcased a cascading composition where architecture, nature, and luxury blended seamlessly. The development featured a ground floor, a podium level, and five residential floors, offering...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'trevino','launched','Trevino',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 03:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (30,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>ALTA V1EW is a contemporary residential development by Object One Real Estate Development, located in the vibrant Jumeirah Village Circle district. The tower features a basement, ground floor, five podium levels, two mezzanine levels, forty six residential floors, and a rooftop, creating a distinctive and elegant presence on the skyline.</p>',NULL,'Object One Real Estate Development',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783937550_alta_exterior_dd57e063ee.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% + 4% DLD + 5050 AED Registration fees\n5% 1. (0.2 per month)\n6% 6%\n5% 1. (0.2 per month)\n6% 6%\n5% 1. (0.2 per month)\n6% 6%\n5% 1. (0.2 per month)\n6% 6%\n50% 50%','AED',1222566.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ALTA V1EW is a contemporary residential development by Object One Real Estate Development, located in the vibrant Jumeirah Village Circle district. The tower features a basement, ground floor, five po...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'alta-v1ew','launched','ALTA V1EW',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 02:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (31,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>The development presents a diverse selection of residences, including studios, one and two bedroom apartments, along with dedicated commercial spaces. The interiors convey a sense of tranquility and understated sophistication, defined by soft neutral palettes and refined textures that create a calm, elevated living environment.</p>',NULL,'Binghatti',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783937124_Image_26_02_2026_at_12_00_PM_21b574ae74.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'50% + 4% DLD + 5000 AED Admin fee Down payment\n30% During construction\n20% On completion','AED',764999.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The development presents a diverse selection of residences, including studios, one and two bedroom apartments, along with dedicated commercial spaces. The interiors convey a sense of tranquility and u...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'binghatti-etherea','launched','Binghatti Etherea',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 01:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (32,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>The project introduces a curated collection of elevated lifestyle experiences, setting a new benchmark for refined urban living. Its contemporary architecture features fluid façade lines, expansive floor to ceiling glazing, and a distinctive silhouette that establishes a bold yet elegant presence on the skyline.</p>',NULL,'Danube',NULL,0,'2029-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783936307_Image_26_02_2026_at_1_09_PM_1_d7d4f634db.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10% + 4% DLD + 1053 AED Admin Fees Downpayment,\n10% April 2026,\n11% (1% Monthly) February 2027 - December 2027,\n11% (1% Monthly) February 2028 - December 2028,\n11% (1% Monthly) February 2029 - December 2029,\n3% January 2027,\n3% January 2028,\n3% January 2029,\n30% (1% Monthly) January 2030 - June 2032,\n8% (1% Monthly)	May 2026 - December 2026','AED',870000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The project introduces a curated collection of elevated lifestyle experiences, setting a new benchmark for refined urban living. Its contemporary architecture features fluid façade lines, expansive fl...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'serenz','launched','SERENZ',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 00:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (33,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>The project features an exquisite collection of studios and one- and two-bedroom residences, each thoughtfully designed with spacious layouts, premium finishes, and seamless functionality. High-end European tile flooring and appliances further elevate the quality of every home.</p>',NULL,'Mashriq Elite Developments',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,0,'uploads/developments/1783895393_Image_27_02_2026_at_2_23_PM_b0c831f650.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% + 2%... On booking,\n5% In May 2026,\n5% In September 2026,\n5% In January 2027,\n5% In May 2027,\n5% In September 2027,\n55 %On completion,','AED',848999.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The project features an exquisite collection of studios and one- and two-bedroom residences, each thoughtfully designed with spacious layouts, premium finishes, and seamless functionality. High-end Eu...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'floarea-skies','launched','Floareá Skies',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-28 23:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (34,NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,'<p>Aria Heights offers studios and one-, two-, and three-bedroom apartments, each distinguished by bright interiors, high ceilings, and panoramic glazing. The finishes use premium materials, including Italian tiles, wooden elements, energy-efficient lighting, and bathroom fittings from European brands Gessi, Geberit, and Flaminia. Kitchens are fully equipped with built-in appliances by Siemens and Smeg.</p>',NULL,'SRG',NULL,0,'2027-12-31',NULL,1,1,'uploads/developments/1783894853_675c10506f96d_sw_aria1_e39d8819fb.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5% + 4% ... On or before reservation,\n15% June 2026,\n20% (5% ... From August 2026 to February 2027,\n10% April 2027,\n10% June 2027,\n10% 6 months after completion of construction,\n10% 12 months after completion of construction,\n10% 18 months after completion of construction,\n10% 24 months after completion of construction','AED',820887.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aria Heights offers studios and one-, two-, and three-bedroom apartments, each distinguished by bright interiors, high ceilings, and panoramic glazing. The finishes use premium materials, including It...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'aria-heights','launched','Aria Heights',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-28 22:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','jvc');
INSERT INTO `developments` VALUES (35,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'<p>Hudayriyat Island is Abu Dhabi’s newest landmark community, offering a rare opportunity to own luxurious waterfront homes in a destination designed for both elegance and vitality. Blending modern architecture with natural surroundings, it brings together serene island living, world-class leisure attractions, and a strong investment outlook—making it one of the capital’s most anticipated developments.</p>',NULL,'ABRA',NULL,0,'2028-12-31',NULL,1,1,'uploads/developments/1783892284_Picture1_cd3a0cacdf.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20% On Booking,\n4% DLD Fee,\n5% 3 month installment,\n5% 6 months installment,\n5% 9 months installment,\n10% 12 months installment,\n5% 15 months from booking,\n15% 15 months from booking,\n5% 18 months from booking ,\n5% 21 months from booking ,\n40% On completion','AED',475000.0000,'Apartment',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hudayriyat Island is Abu Dhabi’s newest landmark community, offering a rare opportunity to own luxurious waterfront homes in a destination designed for both elegance and vitality. Blending modern arch...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'south-lofts-residences','launched','South lofts Residences',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-28 21:00:00','2026-09-30 07:00:00','dubai-south');
